# Unknown URLs now return a real 404 (dist/404.html, see wrangler.toml), so each app route has to be listed here to
# get the app shell (dist/app.html) with a 200. The target must be /app: Cloudflare answers /app.html with a redirect.
# A route missing from this list still works in the browser, because 404.html boots the same app, but it answers with
# a 404 status. `npm run check:seo` fails if src/router/index.tsx and this list drift apart.

